# Concept guest voice

Guest-visible copy in `src/concepts/` must speak as the business.

Do **not** put studio, research, or website-meta narration in headings, body, notices, captions, alts, aria-labels, or footers. Examples of banned voice:

- "this concept / prototype / screen demonstrates"
- "illustrative flavour / queue / structure / sample"
- "generated illustration — not a photograph"
- "from their public website" / research-file framing
- "Mourne Made" or "independent concept by…" outside the shell banner
- Design-evaluation or elevation-method language

Honesty belongs only in:

- `ConceptLayout` banner / `bannerNote`
- `research/`
- code comments

After editing concept copy, run `pnpm test:guest-voice` (also part of `pnpm build`).
